# Docker build context is the repo root (server/Dockerfile needs server/ and
# supabase/migrations/). Allow-list only what the image uses; everything else
# (legacy/, docs, PDFs, .git, local env files, venvs, caches) stays out.
*
!server/pyproject.toml
!server/uv.lock
!server/alembic.ini
!server/app/
!server/migrations/
!supabase/migrations/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
